+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns the resulting JSON value without changing either input. Object patches recursively merge
+with object targets (or an empty object for other targets); a `null` patch member removes that member.
+Arrays and other non-object patches replace the target value entirely. Both inputs must be valid JSON values.
